    english_customer_response_template: 'Hi {{USERNAME}}, the application that was failing to start on your computer depends on a Windows service, and that service was not starting correctly. We read the system event log and found the exact reason: the account the service uses to run had an expired password. We updated the service configuration, set it to start automatically, and confirmed it is now running even after a full restart. The application should work normally now; please open it and try the task that was failing. If it stops again after a reboot, reply to ticket {{TICKET_ID}} and we will re-check the service events right away.',
