    english_customer_response_template: 'Hi {{USERNAME}}, Teams was letting you chat but failing whenever you made or received calls. The test call showed your microphone and speaker are fine, so we checked the network path Teams calls use: the connection to the service was healthy, but the firewall on your computer was blocking the media traffic for the desktop client. We enabled the required rules and calls now connect and stay connected. Please make a short test call with a colleague to confirm. If calls fail again specifically while connected to the VPN, reply to ticket {{TICKET_ID}} — that tells us the tunnel needs a configuration review with the network team.',
